  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Government Debt &amp; Infrastructure Finance - Vietnam IFT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide TA to Vietnam Electricity (EVN), a state-owned enterprise (SOE) that reports directly to the Prime Minister. The Advisor will provide technical assistance to EVN to (1) develop an analytical framework to support EVNs assessment of opportunities in asset divestment and alternatives for raising funds; (2) develop financial and legal structures needed for implementation of strategic partnerships, acquisitions, tenders and refinancing for designated divestments; (3) develop strategies to access domestic and international capital markets by issuing corporate debt; (4) design and structure projects eligible for Green Bonds designation; (5) develop institutional capacity programs for the Finance and Accounting Department; and, (6) strengthen relationships between EVN and other donor agencies and MDBs.</narrative>
  </description>
